WEBVTT

00:00:00.820 --> 00:00:03.250
Previously on Yu-Gi-Oh! VRAINS:

00:00:03.520 --> 00:00:04.880
Ai...

00:00:04.880 --> 00:00:08.690
Ai is taking this very seriously.

00:00:08.690 --> 00:00:14.690
It's true that humans created 
- and destroyed - the Ignis.

00:00:14.690 --> 00:00:17.700
And left you alone in the end.

00:00:17.700 --> 00:00:24.940
Since SOL Technologies created the Ignis, 
as its employee, I want to apologize.

00:00:25.380 --> 00:00:27.910
I'm very sorry.

00:00:28.440 --> 00:00:29.880
Brother?

00:00:30.140 --> 00:00:33.360
But as an executive at SOL Technologies...

00:00:33.360 --> 00:00:37.850
...my duty is to protect its thousands 
of employees and their families.

00:00:37.850 --> 00:00:40.560
That's why I can't give you the code key!

00:00:40.560 --> 00:00:42.590
Please back off, Ai!

00:00:42.880 --> 00:00:46.420
Then fight for those you protect!

00:00:46.420 --> 00:00:48.870
I don't need an apology!

00:00:48.870 --> 00:00:51.860
Accept your fate and duel!

00:00:52.810 --> 00:00:55.620
Your accusations are true.

00:00:55.620 --> 00:00:57.510
But it is what it is!

00:00:57.510 --> 00:01:01.610
I'll stop you for those I protect!

00:01:02.100 --> 00:01:03.050
Brother!

00:01:04.510 --> 00:01:07.350
Open!  The circuit that unites us!

00:01:09.050 --> 00:01:10.410
Link Summon!

00:01:10.410 --> 00:01:12.520
Appear, Link 3!

00:01:13.690 --> 00:01:16.560
Tindangle Acute Cerberus!

00:01:17.300 --> 00:01:19.780
Sibling power, huh?

00:01:19.780 --> 00:01:20.960
Show it to me!

00:01:23.410 --> 00:01:32.680
calling & feeling  I take your 
thoughts to heart  VRAINS

00:01:51.270 --> 00:02:00.640
The data storm grazes my cheek, 
so I can't open my eyes

00:02:01.280 --> 00:02:10.590
What are we trying to find?  
Where are we trying to go?

00:02:11.150 --> 00:02:15.830
I won't make anyone sad anymore

00:02:16.160 --> 00:02:24.370
I'll retrieve you  Let's go and look ahead

00:02:24.630 --> 00:02:29.510
By meeting you, the world is in color

00:02:29.900 --> 00:02:35.180
I'll protect you with an unseen bond

00:02:35.480 --> 00:02:39.490
calling  With invisible wings

00:02:39.780 --> 00:02:50.100
Destroy the dark and weakness within me

00:03:07.640 --> 00:03:10.880
Tindangle Acute Cerberus's effect!

00:03:10.880 --> 00:03:14.020
When there are at least three types
 of Tindangles  in the graveyard,

00:03:14.020 --> 00:03:16.770
including Tindangle Base Gardna...

00:03:17.080 --> 00:03:20.100
...it gains 3000 ATK!

00:03:20.480 --> 00:03:26.250
And for every Tindangle next 
to its link, it gains 500 ATK!

00:03:28.580 --> 00:03:34.490
Battle!  Acute Cerberus attacks 
Fire Phoenix @Ignister!

00:03:35.010 --> 00:03:39.290
Huh?  He attacked with 3500 ATK?

00:03:39.290 --> 00:03:44.980
Judgment Arrows's effect will 
raise Fire Phoenix's ATK to 4600.

00:03:44.980 --> 00:03:48.150
Cerberus is a dead dog, Bro!

00:03:48.150 --> 00:03:50.190
You made a pun?

00:03:50.800 --> 00:03:52.610
What are you thinking?

00:03:54.180 --> 00:03:58.650
I activate Marincess Decision's 
effect from the graveyard!

00:03:58.650 --> 00:04:01.890
By banishing this card and Marbled Rock...

00:04:01.890 --> 00:04:09.960
...your monster loses ATK equal to the 
banished monster's original ATK this turn!

00:04:10.260 --> 00:04:13.500
Fire Phoenix has 0 ATK.

00:04:14.290 --> 00:04:15.970
So that's your plan!

00:04:16.360 --> 00:04:19.140
Acute Math Blaze!

00:04:28.240 --> 00:04:29.460
Bro!

00:04:29.460 --> 00:04:31.330
Not bad!

00:04:31.330 --> 00:04:34.520
Achichi @Ignister's effect 
activates from my graveyard!

00:04:35.040 --> 00:04:38.760
When my Fire monster is 
destroyed in battle...

00:04:38.760 --> 00:04:43.530
...by banishing this card, its 
effect destroys Fire Phoenix!

00:04:46.100 --> 00:04:50.340
You used an effect to destroy a monster 
that would've been destroyed in battle?

00:04:50.340 --> 00:04:53.070
Fire Phoenix's effect activates!

00:04:53.700 --> 00:04:59.180
When an effect destroys and sends it to the 
graveyard, one of your monsters is destroyed!

00:04:59.180 --> 00:05:03.250
I select Tindangle Hound.

00:05:03.250 --> 00:05:04.560
Nice, Bro!

00:05:04.560 --> 00:05:07.250
You take advantage of every situation!

00:05:08.450 --> 00:05:10.220
This is what you were aiming for!

00:05:10.220 --> 00:05:11.240
Brother!

00:05:11.240 --> 00:05:11.920
Right!

00:05:11.920 --> 00:05:15.470
Marincess Basilalima's 
effect from the graveyard!

00:05:15.470 --> 00:05:20.400
When an effect will destroy a monster, 
I can banish this card instead!

00:05:21.190 --> 00:05:25.670
Then one monster gains 600 ATK!

00:05:25.670 --> 00:05:29.400
I select Acute Cerberus!

00:05:29.770 --> 00:05:32.780
Acute Cerberus's effect activates!

00:05:32.780 --> 00:05:37.850
Since it attacked, I Special Summon 
a Tindangle Token after the battle!

00:05:39.750 --> 00:05:45.720
Since there's another Tindangle 
next to its link, it gains 500 ATK!

00:05:46.960 --> 00:05:49.930
4600 ATK?

00:05:49.930 --> 00:05:53.160
I end my turn.

00:05:53.160 --> 00:05:57.640
Wow!  Blue Maiden and Zaizen are in sync!

00:05:57.880 --> 00:06:00.980
Is this the bond between siblings?

00:06:01.570 --> 00:06:03.110
It's impressive!

00:06:03.360 --> 00:06:07.570
Ai, we both tried to protect Aqua.

00:06:07.570 --> 00:06:09.610
I don't want to fight you.

00:06:09.610 --> 00:06:17.690
But if you're going to defeat my brother 
and take his code key, I will protect him!

00:06:17.690 --> 00:06:21.670
Good!  Keep fighting!

00:06:21.670 --> 00:06:26.030
Show me more of this sibling love!

00:06:26.030 --> 00:06:27.500
Stop joking!

00:06:27.500 --> 00:06:31.590
Actually, I don't sense 
any ill will from him.

00:06:31.590 --> 00:06:34.610
What?  So that's how he truly feels?

00:06:34.610 --> 00:06:38.940
Show me something more special.

00:06:39.820 --> 00:06:41.180
Ai...

00:06:41.180 --> 00:06:47.940
Let's see who's stronger: One who has 
something to protect or one who has nothing to lose.

00:06:48.580 --> 00:06:51.020
My turn!  I draw!

00:06:51.260 --> 00:06:53.760
Fire Phoenix's effect activates!

00:06:54.240 --> 00:06:57.730
Resurrect, Fire Phoenix!

00:06:57.730 --> 00:07:00.970
Then I summon Hiyari @Ignister!

00:07:00.970 --> 00:07:05.800
Ai is dueling as if he has nothing to lose.

00:07:05.800 --> 00:07:08.940
I sense sadness in his duel.

00:07:09.340 --> 00:07:15.050
When I lost my friends, I felt 
a similar pain in my heart.

00:07:17.640 --> 00:07:22.500
Nothing to lose...  Ai is lonely.

00:07:22.500 --> 00:07:25.680
But right now, he's the enemy.

00:07:25.680 --> 00:07:28.100
You shouldn't feel sympathetic.

00:07:28.100 --> 00:07:29.890
That's true, but...

00:07:32.060 --> 00:07:34.780
It resurrected Fire Phoenix.

00:07:34.780 --> 00:07:40.220
But even if it uses Judgment Arrows, 
Fire Phoenix will have 4600 ATK.

00:07:40.220 --> 00:07:43.640
It won't be stronger than Zaizen's monster.

00:07:43.640 --> 00:07:46.640
What will you do, Dark Ignis?

00:07:46.640 --> 00:07:48.610
Hiyari's effect activates!

00:07:48.880 --> 00:07:55.580
By tributing a different @Ignister, I 
add Ai's Ritual from my deck to my hand.

00:07:55.580 --> 00:07:59.200
Since I tributed a Link Monster 
to activate this effect...

00:07:59.200 --> 00:08:04.900
...it gains Levels equal to its Link 
Markers until the end of the turn.

00:08:04.900 --> 00:08:12.370
And Hiyari's effect adds an @Ignister 
Ritual Monster from my deck to my hand!

00:08:12.760 --> 00:08:15.700
I activate the Ritual Spell, Ai's Ritual!

00:08:16.840 --> 00:08:21.000
To Ritual Summon, I tribute @Ignisters 
from my hand and field...

00:08:21.000 --> 00:08:25.620
...whose total Level equal or 
exceed the Ritual Monster's Level!

00:08:25.620 --> 00:08:27.020
Ritual Summon?

00:08:27.020 --> 00:08:31.340
But if there's a Water 
@Ignister on the field...

00:08:31.340 --> 00:08:36.240
...I can banish an @Ignister from 
my graveyard instead of tributing.

00:08:37.310 --> 00:08:39.170
I tribute Hiyari!

00:08:39.170 --> 00:08:41.460
And banish Pikari from my graveyard!

00:08:44.610 --> 00:08:49.170
Appear!  The water god dragon 
that hides in the ocean!

00:08:49.170 --> 00:08:51.320
Ritual Summon!

00:08:54.800 --> 00:08:58.160
Water Leviathan @Ignister!

00:08:59.350 --> 00:09:02.350
Water Leviathan's effect activates!

00:09:02.350 --> 00:09:04.320
When it's Ritual Summoned,

00:09:04.320 --> 00:09:11.060
all your monsters whose 
original ATK are 2300 or lower return to your hand!

00:09:11.060 --> 00:09:12.560
What?

00:09:16.900 --> 00:09:22.370
The Dark Ignis struck Acute 
Cerberus's blind spot.

00:09:22.370 --> 00:09:27.610
And I return all Link Monsters 
in my graveyard to my Extra Deck.

00:09:27.610 --> 00:09:35.350
And for every Link Marker they 
have, your monster loses 600 ATK.

00:09:35.600 --> 00:09:41.360
I return Link 1 Linguriboh, Link 
3 Fire Phoenix and Dark Templar.

00:09:41.830 --> 00:09:45.800
That's a total of 7 Link Markers!

00:09:45.800 --> 00:09:49.030
I'm lowering that monster's ATK!

00:09:49.260 --> 00:09:51.040
Tindangle Hound!

00:09:51.040 --> 00:09:55.040
It loses 600 per Link Marker, so...

00:09:56.510 --> 00:09:59.310
It loses 4200 ATK!

00:09:59.310 --> 00:10:00.910
Bro, you're too good!

00:10:01.950 --> 00:10:03.820
Here I go!  Battle!

00:10:03.820 --> 00:10:07.880
Water Leviathan attacks Hound!

00:10:09.790 --> 00:10:11.070
Oh no!

00:10:11.070 --> 00:10:15.790
But Judgment Arrows doesn't 
affect Water Leviathan.

00:10:15.790 --> 00:10:18.980
He'll just be able to survive this ATK.

00:10:18.980 --> 00:10:21.770
I see.  He'll have 100 LP left.

00:10:21.770 --> 00:10:26.600
But will Ai attack so foolishly?

00:10:26.920 --> 00:10:29.460
Water Leviathan's effect!

00:10:29.460 --> 00:10:35.100
When your monster battles, 
its ATK are halved!

00:10:36.080 --> 00:10:41.690
250 ATK...  If this gets 
through, Zaizen is out of LP!

00:10:48.180 --> 00:10:49.590
Brother!

00:10:51.960 --> 00:10:54.330
What?  What's going on?

00:10:54.330 --> 00:10:57.070
Zaizen has LP!

00:11:01.520 --> 00:11:08.510
When you attacked, I activated the 
Continuous Trap, Marincess Bubble Circle.

00:11:08.800 --> 00:11:16.050
For every Link Marker that Marincesses in the 
graveyard have, Bubble Circle restores 100 LP.

00:11:16.050 --> 00:11:20.480
Blue Slug and Coral Anemone 
are in my graveyard.

00:11:20.480 --> 00:11:23.540
They have a total of 3 Link Markers!

00:11:23.540 --> 00:11:26.700
My brother regained 300 LP!

00:11:27.200 --> 00:11:31.800
Blue Maiden anticipated 
Zaizen would be in danger.

00:11:36.150 --> 00:11:37.640
I told you!

00:11:38.130 --> 00:11:41.110
That I'll protect my brother!

00:11:41.110 --> 00:11:43.280
Yeah.  Impressive!

00:11:43.280 --> 00:11:45.220
You can do it if you try!

00:11:45.220 --> 00:11:48.690
I set a card and end my turn!

00:11:49.140 --> 00:11:52.780
Keep it up and protect him to the end.

00:11:59.410 --> 00:12:01.660
I will protect my brother.

00:12:01.660 --> 00:12:04.100
I won't let him get the code key!

00:12:04.620 --> 00:12:07.070
My turn!  I draw!

00:12:07.070 --> 00:12:10.040
I summon Marincess Blue Tang!

00:12:10.040 --> 00:12:12.470
Blue Tang's effect activates!

00:12:12.470 --> 00:12:16.250
I send Marincess Sea Horse 
from my deck to my graveyard!

00:12:16.910 --> 00:12:18.700
Link Summon!

00:12:18.700 --> 00:12:23.420
Appear, Link 1 Marincess Blue Slug!

00:12:23.420 --> 00:12:25.830
Blue Slug's effect!

00:12:25.830 --> 00:12:28.330
I add Sea Horse from my graveyard to my hand!

00:12:28.330 --> 00:12:30.800
Then Blue Tang's effect!

00:12:30.800 --> 00:12:36.900
I flip over three cards in my deck, and I 
add one Marincess among them to my hand!

00:12:37.160 --> 00:12:40.540
I add Crown Tail to my hand!

00:12:40.540 --> 00:12:45.370
I Special Summon Sea Horse 
next to Blue Slug's link!

00:12:46.100 --> 00:12:47.510
Link Summon!

00:12:48.750 --> 00:12:53.320
Appear, Link 2 Marincess Coral Anemone!

00:12:55.320 --> 00:12:57.360
Coral Anemone's effect!

00:12:57.360 --> 00:13:01.200
I summon Blue Slug from the 
graveyard next to its link!

00:13:02.960 --> 00:13:05.500
I Link Summon again!

00:13:07.300 --> 00:13:12.080
Appear, Link 3 Marincess Marbled Rock!

00:13:13.810 --> 00:13:16.910
Coral Anemone's effect 
activates from my graveyard!

00:13:16.910 --> 00:13:19.780
I add Blue Tang from my graveyard to my hand!

00:13:19.780 --> 00:13:23.500
Then Sea Horse's effect 
activates from my graveyard!

00:13:23.500 --> 00:13:29.130
I banish it to Special Summon Crown Tail 
from my hand next to Marincess's link!

00:13:30.860 --> 00:13:32.880
And once again!

00:13:32.880 --> 00:13:36.730
Shine!  The circuit of love and bonds!

00:13:36.730 --> 00:13:41.000
The summoning conditions are 
at least two Water monsters!

00:13:45.600 --> 00:13:48.240
The mother ocean's deep blue!

00:13:48.240 --> 00:13:52.880
Gather in my hand for the power 
of affection and purification!

00:13:53.400 --> 00:13:55.060
Link Summon!

00:13:56.010 --> 00:14:02.110
Appear, Link 4 Marincess Great Bubble Reef!

00:14:03.920 --> 00:14:05.230
Link 4!

00:14:05.230 --> 00:14:07.200
Great Bubble Reef...

00:14:07.200 --> 00:14:10.290
Blue Maiden's new ace monster!

00:14:10.740 --> 00:14:14.670
The Continuous Trap, Marincess 
Bubble Circle's effect!

00:14:14.670 --> 00:14:20.040
I banish a Level 5 or higher Marincess 
from my graveyard to deal 100 damage!

00:14:23.440 --> 00:14:28.130
You summoned a new Link 4 ace 
monster, but only dealt 100 damage?

00:14:28.130 --> 00:14:29.650
What's the point?

00:14:29.650 --> 00:14:33.520
Great Bubble Reef's effect activates!

00:14:33.520 --> 00:14:37.320
When a monster is banished 
from the field or graveyard...

00:14:37.320 --> 00:14:41.600
...it gains 600 ATK until 
the end of the turn!

00:14:42.490 --> 00:14:46.460
I see.  That's what the 100 damage was for.

00:14:46.460 --> 00:14:49.470
Ai has 300 LP left.

00:14:49.470 --> 00:14:56.440
But Water Leviathan has 2300 ATK - and an 
effect that halves the opponent's monster's ATK.

00:14:56.440 --> 00:15:01.410
To destroy it in battle, 
you need at least 4600 ATK.

00:15:01.410 --> 00:15:03.220
What's wrong?

00:15:03.220 --> 00:15:06.880
You can't destroy my monster with those ATK!

00:15:06.880 --> 00:15:10.860
Next, I activate Tindangle Returner's 
effect from the graveyard!

00:15:10.860 --> 00:15:16.240
It returns to my hand, and a banished 
monster returns to the graveyard!

00:15:16.860 --> 00:15:19.860
I return Crown Tail to my graveyard!

00:15:20.380 --> 00:15:24.970
The Continuous Trap, Bubble 
Circle's effect again!

00:15:24.970 --> 00:15:31.080
I banish the Crown Tail that returned 
to my graveyard to deal 100 damage!

00:15:33.680 --> 00:15:36.040
Ai has 200 LP.

00:15:36.040 --> 00:15:39.780
Blue Maiden is an expert 
at dealing effect damage.

00:15:39.780 --> 00:15:44.340
Her goal is to use effect 
damage to shave away his LP.

00:15:45.090 --> 00:15:47.780
Great Bubble Reef's effect activates!

00:15:47.780 --> 00:15:49.830
It gains 600 ATK!

00:15:51.500 --> 00:15:54.570
Great Bubble Reef's additional 
effect activates!

00:15:54.570 --> 00:15:57.580
I send a Marincess in my hand to my graveyard

00:15:57.580 --> 00:16:01.020
to Special Summon the banished Crown Tail!

00:16:03.070 --> 00:16:06.080
Brother, I'm using your card!

00:16:07.940 --> 00:16:13.420
I activate Tindangle Returner's effect 
from my hand on Great Bubble Reef!

00:16:13.420 --> 00:16:18.400
Once per turn, it tributes a 
monster to Special Summon itself!

00:16:21.360 --> 00:16:28.730
And Great Bubble Reef gains Crown 
Tail's ATK until the end of the turn!

00:16:29.430 --> 00:16:32.100
4400 ATK.

00:16:32.100 --> 00:16:34.750
Crown Tail also returned to the graveyard.

00:16:34.750 --> 00:16:38.100
If Bubble Circle's effect activates again...

00:16:38.100 --> 00:16:43.780
...the Dark Ignis will lose LP again, and 
Great Bubble Reef's ATK will increase.

00:16:44.840 --> 00:16:47.250
This is bad, Bro!

00:16:47.250 --> 00:16:50.250
Bring it on, Blue Maiden!

00:16:50.250 --> 00:16:56.730
Protect the one who's dear 
to you!  Try to defeat me!

00:16:56.730 --> 00:16:59.300
He's flustered.

00:16:59.300 --> 00:17:03.470
But be aware of his ability to escape danger.

00:17:03.470 --> 00:17:05.660
I won't go easy on him!

00:17:05.660 --> 00:17:08.210
Crown Tail's effect activates 
from my graveyard!

00:17:08.760 --> 00:17:10.940
I banish this card from my graveyard.

00:17:10.940 --> 00:17:18.680
For each different type of Marincess, 1000 
battle damage become 0 per Link Marker this turn!

00:17:18.680 --> 00:17:22.960
Marincesses in the graveyard 
have 6 Link Markers.

00:17:22.960 --> 00:17:29.160
Even if Water Leviathan's ATK increase, 
6000 or lower battle damage become 0.

00:17:29.480 --> 00:17:32.160
You're so cautious.

00:17:32.160 --> 00:17:35.900
There are no counters for this battle.

00:17:35.900 --> 00:17:38.900
You provoked her, but it backfired!

00:17:38.900 --> 00:17:42.550
I'll get revenge for you, Bro!

00:17:42.550 --> 00:17:44.280
I haven't lost yet!

00:17:44.280 --> 00:17:47.770
Great Bubble Reef's effect activates!

00:17:47.770 --> 00:17:50.280
It gains 600 ATK!

00:17:52.620 --> 00:17:54.560
5000 ATK!

00:17:54.560 --> 00:17:58.900
Instead of effect damage, this is 
what Blue Maiden was going for.

00:17:58.900 --> 00:18:02.760
Now even if Water Leviathan halves its ATK...

00:18:02.760 --> 00:18:06.730
...if this attack gets through, 
she'll defeat the Dark Ignis!

00:18:07.340 --> 00:18:11.970
My brother has saved me all my life.

00:18:13.570 --> 00:18:22.080
He didn't want me going to LINK VRAINS 
because he wanted to protect me from danger.

00:18:23.850 --> 00:18:29.590
But now, I'm fighting alongside my brother.

00:18:30.880 --> 00:18:34.360
From now on, I'll be the 
one to protect my brother!

00:18:34.640 --> 00:18:35.820
Let's battle!

00:18:35.820 --> 00:18:41.600
Marincess Great Bubble Reef attacks 
Water Leviathan @Ignister!

00:18:45.070 --> 00:18:46.300
Here it comes!

00:18:46.930 --> 00:18:48.840
Water Leviathan's effect!

00:18:48.840 --> 00:18:52.140
Your monster's ATK are halved!

00:18:52.140 --> 00:18:53.720
Go!

00:18:53.720 --> 00:18:56.750
You're gonna lose, Bro!

00:18:56.750 --> 00:19:00.350
You can't protect him!

00:19:00.760 --> 00:19:03.320
I activate the trap, HAi!

00:19:03.320 --> 00:19:09.040
If monsters battle during your 
turn that I take effect damage...

00:19:09.040 --> 00:19:13.830
...you take damage equal to double 
the difference in their ATK.

00:19:15.600 --> 00:19:18.360
Strike back, Water Leviathan!

00:19:19.890 --> 00:19:23.220
The difference in their ATK is 200!

00:19:23.220 --> 00:19:25.360
And the effect damage is double!

00:19:25.360 --> 00:19:29.450
Crown Tail's effect can 
only block battle damage.

00:19:35.790 --> 00:19:37.760
Aoi!

00:19:38.020 --> 00:19:39.720
Brother!

00:19:48.390 --> 00:19:50.920
You failed to protect him.

00:19:52.310 --> 00:19:54.440
Brother...

00:19:54.440 --> 00:19:55.570
Aoi...

00:20:01.010 --> 00:20:05.420
We'll never be apart again, Aoi.

00:20:05.760 --> 00:20:07.760
Same here.

00:20:07.760 --> 00:20:12.320
I'll be by your side forever-

00:20:13.580 --> 00:20:14.630
Brother!

00:20:16.410 --> 00:20:18.050
Why?

00:20:23.140 --> 00:20:27.140
My brother and I lost the duel as a tag team!

00:20:27.140 --> 00:20:31.840
So why is only my brother gone?

00:20:31.840 --> 00:20:35.480
Are you showing compassion?  
That's not like you, Bro.

00:20:35.480 --> 00:20:38.580
Compassion?  It's not that.

00:20:40.370 --> 00:20:42.400
I won't erase you.

00:20:42.400 --> 00:20:50.390
You - like me - will continue living with 
regret for failing to protect someone dear to you.

00:20:58.250 --> 00:21:01.840
As promised, I'm taking the code key.

00:21:01.840 --> 00:21:05.570
See ya.  You take care too, Pandor.

00:21:06.340 --> 00:21:07.840
Let's go, Roboppi.

00:21:07.840 --> 00:21:09.720
Okay, Bro!

00:21:09.720 --> 00:21:10.210
Ai!

00:21:10.940 --> 00:21:14.140
What's up, Playmaker?

00:21:14.950 --> 00:21:16.400
You...

00:21:18.340 --> 00:21:20.740
If there's nothing, I'm going.

00:21:21.620 --> 00:21:22.860
Wait!

00:21:23.180 --> 00:21:27.060
You've gone too far!

00:21:27.060 --> 00:21:29.530
No, it's fine.

00:21:31.530 --> 00:21:36.240
I can now erase you without any hesitation.

00:21:36.580 --> 00:21:39.240
I promise to end you!

00:21:44.340 --> 00:21:47.680
Let's meet again, Playmaker.

00:21:48.950 --> 00:21:50.120
Ai...

00:21:52.690 --> 00:21:54.360
I'm sorry.

00:21:59.890 --> 00:22:01.960
Brother...

00:22:05.190 --> 00:22:09.160
I was told repeatedly

00:22:09.160 --> 00:22:16.610
Only tales of dreams

00:22:16.960 --> 00:22:23.580
Is my life precious?

00:22:23.840 --> 00:22:26.570
Make up for  Make up for

00:22:26.940 --> 00:22:34.080
The next sentimental

00:22:38.920 --> 00:22:45.340
I'm not a machine

00:22:48.060 --> 00:22:51.780
I cry a single tear

00:22:53.270 --> 00:22:57.000
A single answer moves me

00:22:58.170 --> 00:23:07.360
We helplessly sing for someone we can't reach

00:23:07.980 --> 00:23:12.790
Are you ready?

00:23:13.290 --> 00:23:18.140
Oh oh oh

00:23:18.660 --> 00:23:23.360
Are you ready?

00:23:23.960 --> 00:23:30.450
Are you ready?

00:23:38.020 --> 00:23:41.010
Security eyes glow in the building.

00:23:41.010 --> 00:23:44.690
Until yesterday, this was SOL Technologies.

00:23:44.690 --> 00:23:50.880
But the androids are now in control, 
and human workers are gone.

00:23:50.880 --> 00:23:55.860
Now that Ai took over SOL 
Technologies, what will he do next?

00:23:55.860 --> 00:23:59.720
No one knows what he'll do.

00:23:59.720 --> 00:24:03.910
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh! VRAINS:
SOL's Decline

00:24:03.910 --> 00:24:06.250
Into the VRAINS!
